{"id":"4322","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4322_main_cirrus-floccus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张照片展示了卷云的分离圆形云簇的一个很好的例子，就像画家在画布上轻拍画笔，这可将其识别为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷云</span>。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">尾迹</span>经常出现在云簇之下。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Pierre Verlhac","location":"法国伊泽尔省克洛尔","latitude":"纬度: 45° 17' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 52' 59'' E","date":"17 August 2014 0000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.7"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4877_main_cirrus-floccus-over-tallinn-estonia_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在夏末的这个温暖的日子里，形成了壮观的絮状卷云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jüri Kamenik","location":"爱沙尼亚塔林皮尔古里姆","latitude":"纬度: 59° 26' 8'' N","longitude":"经度: 24° 43' 8'' E","date":"28 August 2013 1502 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.7"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5169_main_cirrus-floccus-radiatus-with-cumulus-humilis-and-fractus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>图中的主云为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷云</span>。其构成为单独的圆形簇（在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>可见），其后的冰晶拖尾（在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>可见）落至低空。云的有些部分排列成<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">平行带状并且为辐辏状云类</span>。在图片的下三分之一处有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"13 June 2014 1223 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.7"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5170_main_cirrus-floccus-radiatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在这个相对特写图中，冰晶拖尾（在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>可见）从絮状卷云的圆簇（在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>可见）落至低空。云呈白色，无阴影。在图片下部，云素呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">平行线排列，而且为辐辏状云类</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"13 June 2014 1224 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.7"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4515_main_cirrus-floccus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>卷云呈现积云状簇团的外观（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>），这些簇团拖曳着下落冰晶形成的丝缕（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>），因此卷云被归类为絮状云。更远处的絮状云<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在5号位置</span>大部分处于前景云的阴影中。高空风为西南风，由西侧约200公里处的静止槽所致。风速从500百帕层的10米/秒增至250百帕层的25米/秒，均来自西南方向。因此存在西南向的垂直风切变，冰晶从卷云簇团中飘落。地面风力较弱。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.A. Keen","location":"Ajo, Arizona, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 32° 22' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 112° 51' 39'' W","date":"20 October 1981 1700 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4514_main_cirrus-floccus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>(注：估计实际日期为一月)</p>\n<p>在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1处</span>可见具有柔软纤维状轮廓的絮状元素。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2处</span>的元素轮廓坚硬，但似乎与<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1处</span>更具纤维状的元素处于同一高度。天空低处可见一片带状的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高层云</span>。俄克拉荷马州中部位于高空准静止高压脊的北侧。</p></div>","copyright":"© C.A. Doswell","location":"Norman, Oklahoma, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 35° 13' 21'' N","longitude":"经度: 97° 26' 22'' W","date":"15 January 1974 1700 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 1, CH= 2","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}